---

promote all D that are surrounded by 4 normal prey Von-Neumann neighbors to queens

delete queens in predator territory

add D and N everywhere where energy is except if there is a queen

C eats N

A eats N or if there are no N it eats D and if there are no N or D it eats C

add energy to D, remove energy outside prey territory, spread energy

---

a D cell can die:

- 4 N neighbor (promoted to queen)
- eaten by A (if A has no N neighbours) (unlikely)
- less than 3 N neigbors (converted to N instead of D)

energy is only added to the system through D cells

Q (queen) depends on D, D depends on N, N depend on energy, new energy depends on D.

Q reduces D birth and does not count as prey territory (energy is set to zero).

C depeds on N. C eats N before C is attacked by A.

Energy can destroy predators.
